{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1000_017kth", "source_sha256": "4df4e3106a0be2bf8cb320f6e4627c1d2c83526e258b1026a8e518ac432cda4c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお、おはようございます……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n早、早安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1001_p", "source_sha256": "07ff77aed5aac096dab0ae2b53fbb1c7aa3045ae2375ea5996fe235bd6f08681", "ja": "おはよう、琴葉。\nどうした？　なんだか落ち着きがないな。", "zh": "早安，琴叶。\n我看你好像有点紧张，怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "e462a43ae1ea966e84bca94890e2d0fa67d00e715c8d80d48b0d37b181cf657d", "ja": "そ、そうですか？　すみません。\n今、衣装のフィッティングをしていたんですけど……。", "zh": "是、是吗？不好意思。\n我刚才在试穿服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "a6a856173eedc08ff74ac4cbd0c9706d24a4867dcfb1b1b6e32e8c32ac7c6bd2", "ja": "見られるのが、なんだか恥ずかしいというか……。\n似合っているかどうか、あまり自信がなくて……。", "zh": "被别人注目时总觉得……该怎么说，是难为情吗……\n对于穿起来好不好看，我实在没有自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e805166cb70fc4ce6e50ef88694e30c25002ccff42584eeadfe6993ff67d6d28", "ja": "似合ってると思うけどな……気になるところがあれば\nまだ直せるから、意見があったら聞かせて欲しい。", "zh": "我觉得很适合你啊……要是你有在意的部分，\n还来得及再修改，有意见就跟我说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "b171de78e0785ba28d5d90d8b3ef4523bfaccdf5a121d080d5b0cc1a9521024e", "ja": "直すだなんて、そんな！\nあの、本当に素敵な衣装だと思います！", "zh": "怎么会，完全没有必要修改！\n那个，我觉得这套服装真的很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "168295caf0ea88b6dea519223f5d0b6d981853ed319a754627df576064910161", "ja": "むしろ、私の方が見合わないんじゃないかって。\n不安だったのは、そっちなんです。", "zh": "我反而担心自己会不会配不上它，\n这才是我忐忑不安的原因所在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "ca2225291ec0caa254cb8eb377fa20be1ad86ca4db9346cc3e41d3aca1b2e427", "ja": "でも今、似合ってるって言ってもらえたので……\n{$P$}の言葉なら、信じます。", "zh": "不过既然你刚才说了适合我……\n我相信{$P$}你说的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f8130bf35cf1b5e453b1903ec4c97e21b7ec1096e8195f25b80e682396522cf6", "ja": "そうか。それは琴葉のための衣装だから似合って\n当然だし、ちゃんと可愛いよ。自信を持ってくれ！", "zh": "这样啊。那套是为了琴叶所制作的服装，\n当然适合啰。穿起来真的很可爱，你要有自信！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "7284a8484f098641fa3799a0958e56cfdec9a070a8de6e244efa7693bb280a9a", "ja": "か、かわいいって……！　わ、私、えっと……。\nあ、ありがとうございます……。", "zh": "你、你说可爱……！我、我，呃……\n谢、谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "b3d1c009052c183825692267debacf86224f39607e67ba4c8384a676caa515e9", "ja": "あっ、そ、そうだ！　{$P$}、\nここに私物のアイロンを持ち込んでもいいですか？", "zh": "啊，对、对了！{$P$}，\n我可以带自己的熨斗来这里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "0ff680e496c0b4bde8548f9bfd64ed88f800d03bc417b80a23e514114a3c0555", "ja": "この衣装、大事にしたいので……。\nシワにならないように、アイロンをかけないと。", "zh": "因为我想好好珍惜这套服装……\n要用熨斗烫过，不让它起皱褶才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6fabccc744f174fa759708d8ee976dd70f53900d09f3a97b10fd69dca4522466", "ja": "アイロンか……どうだろう。一度青羽さんに\n聞いてみないとだけど、大丈夫ならいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "熨斗吗……这个我不清楚。\n得先问问看青羽小姐，如果她说可以就没问题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "c52be0b6332b1d390638047bfa39ca73648e65c66188479472942e1a0517c31f", "ja": "わかりました。\nそれじゃ、美咲さんに聞いてみますね！", "zh": "我知道了。\n那我去问问看美咲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a06184c463f68c6c9fae0fd7f7dbd0a7c978bd6ef1b30d510e2ec318911b19c4", "ja": "でも、そういうのは\n青羽さんにまかせていいんだぞ？", "zh": "不过这些事，\n其实可以交给青羽小姐喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "8770ce0db0972f2e66363f15657c615260f69dc534370a1728622dffa3fefc8d", "ja": "はい。でも、私の衣装ですから。\n許してくれて、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "好的。不过，这毕竟是我的服装。\n谢谢你同意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "0a9a87365e88f1ed3d2d58de772388e7747b2ee090112c832e21efbcf9330e4c", "ja": "あ、アイロンよりスチーマーの方がいいかな？　防虫剤\nと除湿剤も買ってこなくちゃ。あとブラシと……。", "zh": "啊，比起一般熨斗，蒸汽熨斗会不会比较好？\n还得买防虫剂跟除湿剂。还有刷子跟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_017kth0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_017kth0054_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "dbf59884efe579b5a5ea3725a48dd38658885568777b9d22208cb7f427b66cac", "ja": "洗濯は……近所の電気屋さんで、最新式の洗濯機が\n安売りしてたっけ。貯金、足りるかな……。", "zh": "清洗方面……我记得附近的电器行，\n最新型的洗衣机好像有在特价。不晓得存款够不够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
